    <string name="worlds_empty_no_root">No save folder found.

Since Android 11 a normal app cannot list another app\'s Android/data folder - not even with the \"All files access\" permission. Three workarounds:

1. Copy the saves to /sdcard/Download/TerrariaSaves/ (Worlds and Players subfolders) and this page lists them directly;
2. Use reveal.py + deploy.py from the PC repository to write into the game folder over adb;
3. A rooted device can use the su bridge (later version).</string>
